Note on dependencies: this project itself is MIT, but it links against
PyQt-SiliconUI (https://github.com/ChinaIceF/PyQt-SiliconUI), which is
GPL-3.0. A binary/distribution that includes it has to follow the GPL. Drop
that dependency (see src/ui/) if you need a purely MIT build.
